msgid "Notices"
msgstr ""

#. type: #notices
#: ../src/dashboard.adoc:174
msgid "When a xref:factory-gauge.adoc[factory gauge] is tuned to a network that contains stock links in unloaded chunks, the gauge stops functioning and displays a \"`?`\" on its label. When this happens to any gauge in a factory controller, its dashboard displays a notice near the top-left corner. Hovering the notice displays a tooltip detailing the locations of the unloaded stock links they were last known at."
msgstr ""

